qt6: construct Effect Maker property maps through the Qt factory

Use QQmlPropertyMap::create with explicit unique_ptr ownership. Contexts borrow
the same maps and dynamic key insertion stays unchanged.
https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qqmlpropertymap.html

